Could be simplified:

```suggestion
.version-menu-wrapper {
	overflow: hidden;
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;

	@media (min-width: 600px) {
		&::before {
			content: '•';
			padding-right: 0.25rem;
			color: var(--theme--foreground-subdued);
		}
	}
}
```

Add some space between the icon and the version name.

```suggestion
.version-name {
    margin-left: 0.15em;
```
